            {
              "id": "39a25fb0-9e0c-4f1e-8eb7-0383415bd6a5",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>The Creative Gene</strong></em> was written by Hideo Kojima, published by VIZ Media LLC, October 19, 2021."
            },
            {
              "id": "ad077fdf-935a-486a-a1e6-05d2756a1972",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "74a147a5-6213-497a-8239-44d387845d5d",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>Ever since he was a child, </em>Metal Gear Solid<em> and </em>Death Stranding<em> creator Hideo Kojima was a voracious consumer of movies, music, and books. They ignited his passion for stories and storytelling, and the results can be seen in his groundbreaking, iconic video games. Now the head of independent studio Kojima Productions, Kojima’s enthusiasm for entertainment media has never waned. This collection of essays explores some of the inspirations behind one of the titans of the video game industry, and offers an exclusive insight into one of the brightest minds in pop culture.</em>"
            }
          ]
        },
